nekobox (5.11.28.3-3~ppa1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Packaging-only revision: the PPA is now built from signed 3.0 (quilt)
    Debian source uploads assembled by scripts/source-upload.py, replacing the
    retired Launchpad Git recipe. No upstream change; the pinned 5.11.28.3
    release tarball and its checksum are unchanged.
  * Each series appends its own suffix (~ubuntu24.04.1, ~ubuntu26.04.1,
    ~ubuntu26.10.1) to this revision, so noble, resolute and stonking are
    published from one packaging tree with distinct, ordered versions.

 -- Xu Wei <18422432+weixu000@users.noreply.github.com>  Mon, 23 Nov 2026 17:05:33 +0800

nekobox (5.11.28.3-2~ppa1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Independent packaging for a personal Launchpad PPA, built from the pinned
    upstream 5.11.28.3 unified-source release tarball rather than from another
    PPA's packaging history.
  * Ship the GUI and the sing-box based core in one binary package, installed
    under /usr/libexec/Iblis so both always match.
  * Do not install upstream's /usr/bin/sing-box wrapper, which would conflict
    with a standalone sing-box package.
  * Build the Go parts offline from the vendored dependencies shipped in the
    release tarball (GOPROXY=off, GOSUMDB=off, GOTOOLCHAIN=local).

 -- Oblivion W <oblivion.w23@gmail.com>  Fri, 20 Nov 2026 20:56:07 +0800
